WEBVTT

00:07.616 --> 00:09.376
[If you don't turn yourself in,
your limbs will rot and you'll die]

00:37.833 --> 00:41.153
[All characters and events are fictional,
and any resemblance is coincidental]

00:41.153 --> 00:43.733
[Scenes with children and animals were filmed
safely under professional supervision]

00:44.633 --> 00:47.400
Start with this.

00:47.400 --> 00:51.133
What does '12+2' even mean?

00:51.133 --> 00:53.333
How have you been?

00:53.333 --> 00:55.967
You got married, right? Have kids too?

01:00.533 --> 01:01.600
I'm alone.

01:01.600 --> 01:06.233
Goodness, what have you been
doing all this time?

01:06.233 --> 01:09.233
Back when we were young,
I thought maybe you and Ji Won

01:09.233 --> 01:12.567
would end up getting married.

01:12.567 --> 01:14.667
Ji Won always liked you
more than me, you know?

01:14.667 --> 01:17.400
I don't want to talk about Ji Won.

01:19.033 --> 01:20.767
You even tried to kill Ji Won too.

01:20.767 --> 01:22.900
No, you've got it wrong.

01:22.900 --> 01:26.233
Once I realized it was Ji Won,
I was just going to leave.

01:29.200 --> 01:32.833
But then she happened to take a photo,

01:32.833 --> 01:35.808
and while I was trying to take it from her...

01:37.867 --> 01:40.367
How's Ji Won doing?

01:40.367 --> 01:42.267
- Who knows?
- Oh.

01:42.267 --> 01:44.667
So you don't keep in touch with her?

01:44.667 --> 01:46.800
Don't tell me the friend you lost was Ji Won?

01:46.800 --> 01:48.400
Now,

01:49.200 --> 01:51.167
talk about this first.

01:54.900 --> 02:00.367
[Murder: 12+2, Rape: 19, Attempted: 15]
Well, three of these you'd recognize.

02:01.300 --> 02:03.233
But the really interesting part...

02:07.667 --> 02:09.267
It's over here.

02:11.633 --> 02:14.600
Tae Joo, you probably
couldn't even imagine it.

02:28.933 --> 02:31.264
[Episode 8]

02:39.936 --> 02:42.533
Oh, are you coming around now?

02:52.333 --> 02:53.933
Where am I?

02:53.933 --> 02:55.500
Wait, you don't remember?

02:55.500 --> 02:57.300
Earlier, at the funeral home.

02:57.300 --> 03:00.400
There's nothing seriously wrong.
Just exhaustion.

03:01.667 --> 03:04.733
No, wait. You should
at least finish the IV drip.

03:05.833 --> 03:08.367
[Examination Room]
Wait, Mr. Kang!

03:14.100 --> 03:17.267
Hey, Tae Joo! Are you okay?

03:18.100 --> 03:19.767
What did the doctor say?

03:23.300 --> 03:25.700
You didn't have to push yourself
to come here.

03:26.600 --> 03:28.900
My mother would've appreciated it.

03:30.367 --> 03:34.267
There you go grinning again.
You did the same thing earlier.

03:34.267 --> 03:37.300
- What did you say?
- Before your mother's memorial portrait.

03:37.300 --> 03:40.433
I was gonna let it slide
since you're in mourning.

03:40.433 --> 03:42.700
But you're seriously unbelievable.

03:42.700 --> 03:45.700
- Hey!
- What are you doing now?

03:45.700 --> 03:47.100
The illegal detention of Lee Ki Beom!

03:47.100 --> 03:50.033
I'm arresting you for ordering assault
and unlawful confinement. Let's go!

03:50.033 --> 03:51.333
Just hit me, Tae Joo!

03:51.333 --> 03:52.967
Get over here, you punk!

03:53.633 --> 03:56.533
The chief mourner...
the chief mourner is being arrested.

03:56.533 --> 03:58.500
What kind of nonsense is this?

03:58.500 --> 04:01.056
Some crazy punk put handcuffs
on Prosecutor Cha.

04:01.056 --> 04:02.443
What?

04:03.267 --> 04:05.433
- What are you doing, you punk!
- You punk!

04:05.433 --> 04:06.467
- Let go!
- Get over here, you punk!

04:06.467 --> 04:07.467
Stop!

04:07.467 --> 04:09.200
- Sir, stop it!
- Let go! Stop!

04:09.200 --> 04:11.767
- Let go, you punk!
- Get a grip, you punk!

04:11.767 --> 04:13.120
Let go of me!

04:13.120 --> 04:15.488
- Let go!
- Snap out of it!

04:15.488 --> 04:17.267
- Get a hold of yourself!
- Let go, you punk!

04:17.267 --> 04:19.567
That punk really handcuffed him.

04:19.567 --> 04:21.200
Hey, you punk!

04:22.467 --> 04:23.733
Hey, get him out of here now!

04:23.733 --> 04:25.133
- Let's go.
- I said let go, you punk!

04:25.133 --> 04:26.133
Come on, Tae Joo.

04:26.133 --> 04:27.133
Just stop.

04:27.133 --> 04:29.433
Let go, you punk!

04:53.133 --> 04:55.533
Why would you go that far?

04:55.533 --> 04:58.667
You went too far back there, sir.

04:59.733 --> 05:01.967
I did it to survive.

05:03.000 --> 05:04.800
So...

05:06.667 --> 05:08.900
I could stay alive.

05:11.367 --> 05:13.333
If I just sat there and did nothing,

05:14.267 --> 05:17.067
I felt like I was gonna explode inside first.

05:21.133 --> 05:23.367
I felt like I was gonna die.

05:33.667 --> 05:36.033
Like I was the one dying.

05:53.267 --> 05:56.667
Don't like the alcohol?
Want me to bring something else?

06:02.800 --> 06:06.733
Darn it, it would've been a perfect funeral.

06:07.500 --> 06:11.367
It really could've been a perfect funeral.

06:13.933 --> 06:18.067
I had just caught a serial killer.

06:18.067 --> 06:21.467
It was exactly when I needed
all the attention on me.

06:21.467 --> 06:26.100
But then, that punk Lee Ki Beom
dropped dead and nearly ruined everything.

06:26.833 --> 06:29.967
And right then, my mother passed away.

06:32.100 --> 06:38.200
All the big names from politics and business
showed up to pay their respects to me.

06:39.200 --> 06:43.733
I was making connections
and strengthening my network.

06:44.367 --> 06:49.333
It was like a final gift from my mother.

06:49.333 --> 06:51.867
And then it all went up in smoke.

06:51.867 --> 06:53.900
Because of Kang Tae Joo...

06:55.967 --> 06:58.100
Oh, this...

07:01.333 --> 07:05.767
How am I supposed to
repay this favor, Sang Beom?

07:05.767 --> 07:11.533
What should I do so I can feel
less sorry toward my mother?

07:11.533 --> 07:14.800
Should I turn that punk
into chum in the Pacific?

07:14.800 --> 07:16.667
Just say the word!

07:17.500 --> 07:18.533
I told you, you're not allowed in!

07:18.533 --> 07:22.033
Move, you punk! I need to see Mr. Cha!

07:22.833 --> 07:25.700
Sir!

07:25.700 --> 07:27.667
Please save me!

07:27.667 --> 07:31.233
They said the audit team is going to
investigate me over Lee Ki Beom's death.

07:31.233 --> 07:32.900
Everyone, get out.

07:35.567 --> 07:38.300
In that case, you should
cooperate with the investigation.

07:38.300 --> 07:40.500
Who do you think caused this whole mess?

07:40.500 --> 07:42.333
Excuse me?

07:42.333 --> 07:46.267
I did nothing but faithfully

07:46.267 --> 07:49.800
carry out the tasks you ordered me to do.

07:51.467 --> 07:53.067
What exactly are you implying?

07:53.067 --> 07:57.667
It sounds like you're saying I ordered you
to beat Lee Ki Beom to death, huh?

07:57.667 --> 07:59.067
Did I actually say that?

07:59.067 --> 08:03.500
N-No, that's not what I meant, sir.

08:03.500 --> 08:05.133
I mean, it's...

08:08.167 --> 08:10.233
Listen, Mr. Do Hyeong Gu.

08:11.000 --> 08:15.900
I brought real shame upon myself

08:15.900 --> 08:18.933
in front of my mother today.

08:19.633 --> 08:23.633
I've become a disgraced son.

08:23.633 --> 08:26.200
I'm feeling really shaken up today.

08:28.000 --> 08:30.433
Handle your own problems yourself.

08:30.433 --> 08:32.500
Try denying it to the very end if you want.

08:32.500 --> 08:36.433
Anyway, the victim's dead,
who would know who hit him?

08:39.133 --> 08:41.248
But

08:41.248 --> 08:43.267
about Lee Ki Beom,

08:46.700 --> 08:49.667
was it because of you
that it turned out that way?

08:49.667 --> 08:51.667
Pardon?

08:51.667 --> 08:55.360
I mean, you didn't interrogate him alone.

08:55.360 --> 08:56.455
Right?

08:57.333 --> 09:01.767
Detective Kang Tae Joo
worked hard on it too, right?

09:05.400 --> 09:08.667
Detective Do, did you see anything?

09:11.700 --> 09:13.400
Yes.

09:16.867 --> 09:19.867
I admit to the illegal detention, but,

09:19.867 --> 09:21.867
that's all.

09:21.867 --> 09:25.333
So you're saying there's someone else
who mistreated Lee Ki Beom?

09:25.333 --> 09:27.200
I saw it with my own eyes.

09:27.200 --> 09:31.267
Sergeant Kang Tae Joo was beating
Lee Ki Beom to a pulp.

09:31.267 --> 09:32.833
So I informed the prosecutor,

09:32.833 --> 09:37.533
had the suspect transferred immediately,
and banned all visitation.

09:37.533 --> 09:39.867
Ask Detective Jang Myeong Do
if you don't believe me.

09:39.867 --> 09:43.433
Yes, that's all true.

09:48.000 --> 09:49.660
[Sergeant Kang Tae Joo:
3-month pay suspension]

09:49.660 --> 09:50.900
[and reassignment for suspect abuse]

10:01.633 --> 10:05.867
Mr. Park, what on earth is going on?

10:07.767 --> 10:10.333
This is driving me crazy.

10:10.333 --> 10:14.000
Can they really hand down disciplinary action
without even questioning the accused?

10:15.300 --> 10:18.167
They say they witnessed
you beating Lee Ki Beom.

10:19.000 --> 10:21.267
Who said that?

10:21.267 --> 10:24.667
Jang Myeong Do, Do Hyeong Gu, those punks.

10:24.667 --> 10:28.200
That punk Si Young pulled a nasty stunt.

10:28.200 --> 10:30.933
He must've been really pissed off.

10:30.933 --> 10:33.667
I'm going to file an objection.

10:33.667 --> 10:37.300
You know it's perjury too, don't you, Chief?

10:42.333 --> 10:43.967
Tae Joo.

10:45.367 --> 10:49.400
This audit team was dispatched
from National Police Headquarters.

10:49.400 --> 10:52.933
The commissioner and my father
are practically lifelong buddies.

10:52.933 --> 10:54.592
I really

10:54.592 --> 10:56.900
don't have the authority to handle this.

10:58.367 --> 11:00.733
And Cha Si Young wasn't the only one

11:00.733 --> 11:04.700
who got pissed off because of you that day.

11:04.700 --> 11:08.767
My father too, and everyone else
who was there.

11:11.233 --> 11:13.700
A petty Sergeant,

11:13.700 --> 11:16.667
just a lowly Sergeant!

11:18.767 --> 11:24.133
You actually put handcuffs on a prosecutor,
and during his bereavement at that.

11:24.133 --> 11:30.367
Wow, people like that kind of punk
need to be gently stepped on first.

11:31.904 --> 11:35.067
So they're just

11:35.067 --> 11:39.700
being that low,
pinning this kind of false charge on me?

11:43.167 --> 11:45.344
Just

11:45.344 --> 11:47.233
accept it.

11:49.967 --> 11:52.500
Take some time away from Kangseng.

11:52.500 --> 11:54.067
I'll call you again when the time comes.

11:54.067 --> 11:56.000
I can't do that.

12:03.667 --> 12:06.567
You think I'm asking you right now?

12:21.700 --> 12:23.500
Why is my article not up?

12:23.500 --> 12:25.167
Don't you get it? It got cut.

12:25.167 --> 12:28.333
Why was it cut? It was even
in yesterday's edited version.

12:28.333 --> 12:32.767
The higher-ups cut your article.
And it was on the publisher's orders.

12:32.767 --> 12:34.300
Why would the publisher do that?

12:34.300 --> 12:37.567
Because Prosecutor Cha Si Young,
who ordered that illegal arrest,

12:37.567 --> 12:40.400
is the publisher's future son-in-law.

12:40.400 --> 12:41.933
What?

12:41.933 --> 12:44.367
Ji Won, Ji Won, have you heard the news?

12:44.367 --> 12:46.400
Watch how you address me!

12:46.400 --> 12:48.667
No, that's not important right now.

12:48.667 --> 12:50.600
Well, Tae Joo...

12:50.600 --> 12:52.667
He is the one who caused the suspect's death.

12:52.667 --> 12:56.000
Then the police officer
who killed that suspect is him?

12:56.000 --> 12:57.667
Yes.

12:59.300 --> 13:01.504
There was

13:01.504 --> 13:05.067
actually a request to cover up this incident,

13:05.067 --> 13:09.233
but I refused, so he seems
to be holding a grudge.

13:09.233 --> 13:13.800
Unbelievable, how little must he think
of a prosecutor to go this far?

13:13.800 --> 13:15.233
Who's going to lock this punk up?

13:15.233 --> 13:17.100
I'll do it, sir.

13:17.933 --> 13:21.633
It's an internal police matter.
Do we really need to step in?

13:21.633 --> 13:22.833
It's just a waste of manpower.

13:22.833 --> 13:24.933
Seriously, you...

13:24.933 --> 13:28.367
You're so soft. That's why people
like that crawl all over you.

13:28.367 --> 13:30.167
I'm ashamed, sir.

13:30.167 --> 13:31.367
You handle it.

13:31.367 --> 13:33.667
Yes, understood, sir!

13:35.833 --> 13:38.133
Jeez...

13:48.633 --> 13:50.267
Hey!

13:54.300 --> 13:57.600
How dare you frame me with that accusation?

13:57.600 --> 13:59.300
Are you still human?

13:59.300 --> 14:02.000
You were the one who came at me first.

14:02.867 --> 14:05.133
And at my mother's funeral, of all places.

14:05.133 --> 14:06.733
That crossed the line.

14:06.733 --> 14:12.533
Who's the one who killed a man
and ended up hiding at his mother's funeral?

14:12.533 --> 14:16.733
Do you see it now?
How different you and I are?

14:18.733 --> 14:23.033
Me beating a suspect
like Lee Ki Beom isn't a crime.

14:23.933 --> 14:25.567
But

14:26.233 --> 14:29.100
when you insult me, it is.

14:29.100 --> 14:32.000
That's what we call hierarchy, Tae Joo.

14:32.700 --> 14:34.733
I've told you countless times.

14:34.733 --> 14:36.633
You can't beat me.

14:36.633 --> 14:39.167
We're different from the start.

14:45.667 --> 14:47.733
Twenty-five!

14:48.400 --> 14:50.400
Twenty-six!

14:51.133 --> 14:54.167
Twenty-seven!

14:55.700 --> 14:57.600
So close!

14:57.600 --> 14:59.456
So close!

15:00.233 --> 15:02.500
You were just three away.

15:02.500 --> 15:04.767
Seok Man, fighting!

15:04.767 --> 15:07.167
Back to the start!

15:07.167 --> 15:11.133
I... I can't do this anymore.

15:11.133 --> 15:12.800
So, Seok Man,

15:12.800 --> 15:15.567
just tell me now.

15:15.567 --> 15:18.533
You killed Lee Joo Hee, didn't you?

15:19.433 --> 15:22.433
No, I didn't!

15:22.433 --> 15:25.300
I tried being nice, but that won't work.

15:25.300 --> 15:28.000
Hey, start over!

15:29.200 --> 15:31.100
Please... please spare me.

15:31.100 --> 15:32.267
You punk!

15:32.267 --> 15:34.033
Sit!

15:34.033 --> 15:35.767
Sit!

15:41.267 --> 15:43.133
One.

15:45.500 --> 15:47.133
Two.

15:48.833 --> 15:50.567
Three...

16:11.867 --> 16:14.833
You haven't heard anything weird, have you?

16:14.833 --> 16:16.433
What do you mean?

16:17.567 --> 16:19.000
If not, never mind.

16:19.000 --> 16:20.633
Have you had dinner?

16:22.067 --> 16:23.367
Not in the mood.

16:23.367 --> 16:27.067
Who eats depending on mood?
You eat when it's time to eat.

16:27.733 --> 16:30.200
Just wait a bit, it'll be ready soon.

16:31.000 --> 16:32.000
Sun Young!

16:32.000 --> 16:36.167
Tae Joo, you really need to start living
on your own now, you know?

16:38.033 --> 16:40.567
Try cooking for yourself once in a while.

16:40.567 --> 16:43.567
Stop just filling up
on jjajangmyeon every day.

16:44.533 --> 16:46.400
Are you going somewhere?

16:48.567 --> 16:50.900
I'm getting married, you know.

16:56.267 --> 16:58.433
Has my belly gotten big?

16:59.533 --> 17:02.000
Will it show in the dress?

17:13.400 --> 17:15.833
[Dae Ho Chinese Restaurant]

17:15.833 --> 17:17.133
[A suspect died from police brutality,]

17:17.133 --> 17:19.667
[but the officer who exposed the truth
is being framed as the perpetrator]

17:23.267 --> 17:25.633
No, this article can't run.

17:25.633 --> 17:27.267
Why not?

17:28.200 --> 17:30.667
The illegally arrested suspect
died from torture.

17:30.667 --> 17:34.300
And the detective who reported it
is being framed as the perpetrator.

17:34.300 --> 17:37.133
Your paper should be able to run it.
It's still a major newspaper in Seoul.

17:37.133 --> 17:39.800
Do you even know
who Prosecutor Cha Si Young's father is?

17:39.800 --> 17:42.433
It's retired General Cha Mu Jin.

17:42.433 --> 17:44.433
He's a close friend with the president.

17:44.433 --> 17:46.667
And he's running in the upcoming by-election.

17:46.667 --> 17:50.067
Darn it, on one side, it's the father-in-law,
and on the other, it's the father?

17:50.067 --> 17:51.667
Anyway,

17:52.300 --> 17:54.567
Cha Mu Jin is a dangerous man.

17:54.567 --> 17:58.233
A reporter who investigated
his corruption even got forced out.

17:58.233 --> 18:01.267
Seems like they were seriously tortured.

18:01.267 --> 18:04.600
I'd help if I could,
but you guys should just give it up.

18:04.600 --> 18:06.233
How can we give up?

18:06.233 --> 18:09.700
One person is dead,
and the other is falsely accused.

18:15.333 --> 18:18.233
Ji Won! Let's stop this.

18:18.233 --> 18:20.267
- What?
- I don't want to lose my job.

18:20.267 --> 18:21.833
There's nothing else I can do.

18:21.833 --> 18:24.700
Stop talking nonsense and go get the car!

18:25.567 --> 18:27.900
Why are you taking it out on me?

18:27.900 --> 18:30.367
Jeez, nothing's going right.

18:37.200 --> 18:38.233
Ouch...

18:38.233 --> 18:40.300
Ji Won!

18:40.300 --> 18:42.267
- Are you okay?
- Yeah.

18:47.808 --> 18:49.664
What was that?

18:52.704 --> 18:55.300
Are you sleeping well?

18:55.300 --> 18:58.967
I think I wake up quite often in my sleep.

19:00.067 --> 19:04.033
And I feel spaced out sometimes.

19:04.033 --> 19:07.000
I seem to have a slight headache as well.

19:07.000 --> 19:08.867
How's your mood?

19:08.867 --> 19:10.633
My mood...

19:11.600 --> 19:13.367
I'm not sure.

19:14.633 --> 19:17.167
It's short-term memory loss.

19:17.167 --> 19:18.267
Pardon?

19:18.267 --> 19:21.567
It means she can't remember
specific events or information.

19:23.233 --> 19:25.433
It seems

19:25.433 --> 19:28.200
she couldn't accept her fiancé's death

19:28.200 --> 19:30.700
and erased it from her memory.

19:33.400 --> 19:35.367
So her memory will come back, right?

19:35.367 --> 19:37.133
Of course.

19:37.133 --> 19:38.967
When will that be?

19:38.967 --> 19:41.033
That's uncertain.

19:41.033 --> 19:46.100
It could come back as soon as tomorrow,
or it could take years.

19:46.100 --> 19:50.467
Oh, right. And don't try
to force her memory back.

19:50.467 --> 19:52.700
If she becomes confused,

19:53.767 --> 19:55.833
she might harm herself.

20:05.533 --> 20:09.233
[Bang Kyung Moon Clinic]
My purse! I must've left it in the exam room.

20:09.233 --> 20:12.267
Tae Joo, go wait in the car.
I'll be right back.

20:12.267 --> 20:13.333
Be careful.

20:13.333 --> 20:14.967
Yeah.

20:20.448 --> 20:23.456
[Bang Kyung Moon Clinic]

20:24.833 --> 20:26.600
Ugh, shut up.

20:26.600 --> 20:29.067
I'm telling you,

20:29.067 --> 20:31.233
it's clearly attempted murder.

20:31.233 --> 20:33.333
Stop overreacting.

20:33.333 --> 20:35.467
Hey!

20:35.467 --> 20:37.633
What do you mean?

20:37.633 --> 20:38.800
Attempted murder?

20:38.800 --> 20:41.267
What are you doing here?

20:41.267 --> 20:43.667
You first. What is that supposed to mean?

20:43.667 --> 20:46.533
Oh, it's nothing. He's just overreacting.

20:46.533 --> 20:49.433
Ji Won was trying to clear your name,
but she nearly got killed because of it.

20:49.433 --> 20:52.064
Hey, stop it! Darn it.

20:53.667 --> 20:55.733
Stop this right now.

20:55.733 --> 20:57.567
Don't be ridiculous. It's my article.

20:57.567 --> 21:00.167
They're the ones framing me
just because I put handcuffs on a prosecutor!

21:00.167 --> 21:01.333
You think you'll be safe?

21:01.333 --> 21:03.333
I didn't become a journalist
just to live safely.

21:03.333 --> 21:04.633
Let's find the evidence.

21:04.633 --> 21:06.733
They said the place Ki Beom was held
was a bathhouse, right?

21:06.733 --> 21:08.000
If we can just find that bathhouse...

21:08.000 --> 21:11.100
Neutralizing evidence and bribing witnesses?

21:11.100 --> 21:13.700
That's nothing for those guys.

21:13.700 --> 21:16.400
This isn't something we can win.
Don't you get it?

21:16.400 --> 21:19.600
Those bastards and us,
we're different from the very beginning.

21:19.600 --> 21:22.233
Are you really the Kang Tae Joo I knew?

21:22.233 --> 21:24.667
How could you say something like that?

21:24.667 --> 21:28.233
If we back down now, what about
Ki Beom who died unjustly?

21:28.233 --> 21:31.067
Still, we're like
his older brother and sister.

21:31.067 --> 21:33.833
If we do nothing,
it'd be too cruel to Ki Beom.

21:33.833 --> 21:34.967
What does a dead man even know?

21:34.967 --> 21:36.700
You really...

21:39.400 --> 21:41.867
Ugh, seriously...

21:51.467 --> 21:53.120
What's wrong?

21:53.120 --> 21:54.867
Something bothering you?

21:54.867 --> 21:56.967
They said the baby's healthy, right?

21:58.000 --> 22:00.200
I'm just a bit tired.

22:00.200 --> 22:04.000
It's normal to feel tired.

22:05.367 --> 22:08.867
Don't go out for a while. Just stay home.

22:08.867 --> 22:12.400
If you need anything, just tell me.

22:14.767 --> 22:16.333
Tae Joo.

22:16.333 --> 22:18.200
Yeah.

22:20.200 --> 22:24.467
You'll be a good uncle to my baby, right?

22:25.833 --> 22:28.400
Of course. Do you even have to ask?

22:33.167 --> 22:37.933
Then can you buy me that castella
from the Italian bakery?

22:37.933 --> 22:40.400
The baby wants it.

22:40.400 --> 22:42.000
Now?

22:42.000 --> 22:43.033
It's too far, right?

22:43.033 --> 22:45.867
Not really, it's just an hour round trip.

22:45.867 --> 22:47.633
Don't worry. You wait at home.

22:47.633 --> 22:50.500
I'll buy it and be right back.

23:42.900 --> 23:44.633
Ki Beom.

23:45.333 --> 23:48.400
Ki Beom, Ki Beom, wake up.

23:48.400 --> 23:50.133
Ki Beom!

23:52.133 --> 23:54.767
Ki Beom, you're home.

23:59.733 --> 24:01.800
Ki Beom...

24:02.567 --> 24:05.433
Ki Beom isn't waking up.

24:06.933 --> 24:08.600
Lee Ki Beom.

24:12.167 --> 24:14.133
Wake up!

24:14.133 --> 24:16.000
Ki Beom...

24:17.467 --> 24:19.433
Ki Beom!

25:50.567 --> 25:52.300
Is that really true?

25:52.300 --> 25:53.800
[Family motto, diligence and integrity]
I'm telling you, it is.

25:53.800 --> 25:56.300
My cousin is a patrol officer
at Kangseng Station.

25:56.300 --> 25:57.600
Unbelievable...

25:57.600 --> 26:00.000
How could something like that happen?

26:00.000 --> 26:01.900
What is all this commotion about?

26:01.900 --> 26:03.367
Mother isn't feeling well.

26:03.367 --> 26:07.067
Honey, the police officer
who caused Ki Beom's death apparently...

26:07.067 --> 26:08.400
They say it's Tae Joo.

26:08.400 --> 26:10.267
There could be a misunderstanding.

26:10.267 --> 26:11.867
What misunderstanding?

26:11.867 --> 26:15.133
They say he received disciplinary action
for the Ki Beom case as well.

26:16.067 --> 26:17.933
That can't be true.

26:21.800 --> 26:23.133
You're coming here?

26:23.133 --> 26:26.933
Yes, I'll be there to pick you up
today, Si Young.

26:26.933 --> 26:28.233
Let's have dinner together.

26:28.233 --> 26:30.267
No, I could go myself.

26:30.267 --> 26:32.167
You need days like this too.

26:32.167 --> 26:36.933
I'm leaving home now, so come out
to the main gate by 30 minutes.

26:36.933 --> 26:38.567
Alright.

26:47.067 --> 26:49.367
Sun Young!

26:49.367 --> 26:51.400
I bought the castella.

26:54.367 --> 26:56.000
Sun Young!

26:57.100 --> 26:59.467
Hey, Sun Young!

26:59.467 --> 27:01.100
Sun Young!

27:06.100 --> 27:07.767
Sun Young!

27:14.300 --> 27:15.500
What's this? Blood?

27:15.500 --> 27:18.500
Sun Young... this...

27:18.500 --> 27:21.433
If she becomes confused,
she might harm herself.

27:21.433 --> 27:23.333
Sun Young...

27:24.033 --> 27:26.000
Sun Young!

27:26.000 --> 27:28.767
Sun Young!

27:28.767 --> 27:31.200
Kang Sun Young!

27:31.200 --> 27:32.867
Sun Young!

27:39.800 --> 27:42.600
Oh, there's Tae Joo!

27:42.600 --> 27:46.233
Ki Hwan, calm down
and ask what happened first.

27:46.233 --> 27:48.400
There must be some misunderstanding.

27:48.400 --> 27:49.467
I know that.

27:49.467 --> 27:51.167
Kang Sun Young!

27:51.167 --> 27:52.667
Oh.

27:52.667 --> 27:54.633
Hey!

27:54.633 --> 27:57.033
Have you guys seen Sun Young? Have you...

27:57.033 --> 27:59.800
Ki Hwan, have you seen Sun Young?

27:59.800 --> 28:02.333
Ki Hwan! Ki Hwan!

28:02.333 --> 28:04.367
Is that really what you should
be saying right now?

28:04.367 --> 28:06.233
Do you know how I feel
coming to you like this?

28:06.233 --> 28:07.233
Calm down!

28:07.233 --> 28:10.400
Later. I'll explain everything later.

28:10.400 --> 28:12.433
There is no "later." Answer me now.

28:12.433 --> 28:13.733
Was it really you?

28:13.733 --> 28:16.433
Did Ki Beom die because of you?

28:17.500 --> 28:19.000
Yeah.

28:19.000 --> 28:22.433
It's because of me. There, happy now?

28:22.433 --> 28:23.767
Now let go!

28:23.767 --> 28:25.400
I said let go, you punk!

28:26.533 --> 28:28.800
Hey, you punk!

28:28.800 --> 28:30.700
How could you!

28:30.700 --> 28:32.967
How could you do that?

28:32.967 --> 28:34.633
You!

28:36.400 --> 28:39.233
Do you know what Ki Beom meant to me?

28:39.967 --> 28:42.833
Bring my brother back, you punk!

28:42.833 --> 28:46.033
Bring my brother back!

28:47.933 --> 28:52.133
My brother...

28:55.633 --> 28:57.867
Ki Hwan, I...

28:57.867 --> 28:59.933
Ki Hwan, please.

28:59.933 --> 29:01.600
Help me out.

29:04.067 --> 29:08.300
I know I shouldn't be asking you this.

29:08.300 --> 29:11.100
Please... save Sun Young.

29:11.100 --> 29:12.700
Please save Sun Young!

29:12.700 --> 29:14.100
What do you mean, Tae Joo?

29:14.100 --> 29:17.472
I think Sun Young is trying to kill herself!

29:17.472 --> 29:18.944
I...

29:19.776 --> 29:21.195
Darn it...

29:22.624 --> 29:24.011
Darn it...

29:25.216 --> 29:28.367
Ma'am! Have you seen Sun Young? Sun Young?

29:28.367 --> 29:29.867
I haven't seen Sun Young. Is something wrong?

29:29.867 --> 29:33.133
I'll tell you later.
If you see her, please let me know!

29:33.133 --> 29:34.767
Sun Young!

29:36.267 --> 29:38.100
Sun Young!

29:38.100 --> 29:41.300
- Sun Young!
- Excuse me, have you seen Sun Young?

29:43.433 --> 29:46.567
- Sun Young!
- Sun Young!

29:46.567 --> 29:48.267
Sun Young!

29:50.500 --> 29:52.300
Kang Sun Young!

29:56.133 --> 29:58.033
Sun Young!

30:01.033 --> 30:02.733
Sun Young!

30:03.367 --> 30:04.533
Come down!

30:04.533 --> 30:06.200
Kang Sun Young!

30:13.067 --> 30:14.700
Tae Joo!

30:15.467 --> 30:17.633
Tae Joo!

30:17.633 --> 30:18.933
Tae Joo...

30:18.933 --> 30:20.433
What's wrong, Tae Joo?

30:20.433 --> 30:22.800
Sun Young, Sun Young...

30:22.800 --> 30:25.367
- Sun Young?
- Sun Young...

30:25.367 --> 30:27.133
Sun Young...

30:29.867 --> 30:34.367
Tae Joo, that's not Sun Young.
That's not her.

30:34.367 --> 30:36.167
That's not her.

30:37.067 --> 30:38.867
Look, that isn't Sun Young, right?

30:38.867 --> 30:42.233
I told you not to go to
dangerous places, didn't I?

30:42.233 --> 30:44.800
I told you, didn't I?

30:44.800 --> 30:46.467
Tae Joo!

30:47.900 --> 30:50.000
We found Sun Young!

30:51.433 --> 30:53.900
We found Sun Young.

31:16.833 --> 31:19.067
What are you doing here?

31:19.067 --> 31:21.267
Sun Young, why did you do this!

31:22.733 --> 31:25.920
[Punish murderer Cha Si Young]

31:31.767 --> 31:33.733
Don't you know you can't do this here?

31:33.733 --> 31:35.433
Go away!

31:36.600 --> 31:38.100
I said go!

31:38.100 --> 31:39.400
Let go of me!

31:39.400 --> 31:40.833
Hey, hold her properly!

31:40.833 --> 31:43.367
I told you to go! Jeez...

31:43.367 --> 31:44.433
Let go of me!

31:44.433 --> 31:45.700
Hold her properly!

31:45.700 --> 31:47.733
- Jeez...
- Okay, enough.

31:47.733 --> 31:51.400
It's okay, I'll calm her down.

31:51.400 --> 31:53.533
- Please take this away.
- Yes, sir.

31:53.533 --> 31:54.933
Will you be alright?

31:54.933 --> 31:56.667
It's okay.

31:56.667 --> 32:01.056
[Muwon District Court]

32:03.300 --> 32:04.767
Sun Young,

32:04.767 --> 32:07.000
I think there's been a misunderstanding...

32:13.133 --> 32:15.467
I understand you're deeply hurt.

32:15.467 --> 32:17.567
Shut your mouth!

32:17.567 --> 32:19.200
But...

32:20.000 --> 32:21.900
- Hee Jin!
- What are you?

32:21.900 --> 32:24.633
Who do you think you are to touch my man?

32:27.200 --> 32:28.967
Calm down!

32:28.967 --> 32:31.267
- Don't do this!
- Do you even know who I am?

32:31.267 --> 32:33.167
Please stop!

32:33.167 --> 32:35.233
Si Young!

32:35.233 --> 32:36.433
- You crazy...
- It's okay.

32:36.433 --> 32:37.600
What?

32:37.600 --> 32:40.233
- What?
- I'm okay, really.

32:40.233 --> 32:42.733
You're getting this worked up
over something like this?

32:44.333 --> 32:46.600
Hold it in!

32:46.600 --> 32:50.267
Your man only got a few slaps,

32:50.267 --> 32:53.233
but mine lost his life.

32:53.233 --> 32:55.967
Because of this murderer!

32:58.300 --> 33:00.000
It's okay.

33:06.933 --> 33:09.500
When did your memory come back?

33:09.500 --> 33:11.233
At the hospital.

33:13.167 --> 33:16.267
I heard you and Ji Won talking.

33:18.267 --> 33:20.500
Then you should've told me.

33:20.500 --> 33:24.000
You should've blamed me instead.

33:24.000 --> 33:26.100
I killed Ki Beom.

33:28.867 --> 33:30.567
What?

33:30.567 --> 33:33.000
I told Ki Beom.

33:33.867 --> 33:37.000
Not to confess under any circumstances.

33:39.500 --> 33:42.100
To fight it to the end.

33:43.567 --> 33:45.900
To hold out no matter what.

33:50.567 --> 33:52.833
That's why he ended up dead.

33:55.733 --> 33:58.733
He just kept holding out
and fighting like that.

34:05.900 --> 34:08.133
I ended up killing Ki Beom.

34:09.567 --> 34:11.267
Sun Young.

34:13.867 --> 34:16.900
I should've just told him to go to prison.

34:21.833 --> 34:24.033
10 years, no...

34:24.033 --> 34:26.867
I could've waited even decades if I had to.

34:29.367 --> 34:32.133
I should've told him just not to get hurt.

34:37.733 --> 34:39.533
I should've told him

34:40.200 --> 34:42.867
I'd wait with the baby.

34:43.567 --> 34:45.967
I should've just told him

34:45.967 --> 34:48.667
all he had to do was come back.

35:26.600 --> 35:28.533
What should I do?

35:28.533 --> 35:30.900
Oh my goodness, what should I do?

35:30.900 --> 35:34.400
What if it leaves a scar?

35:36.533 --> 35:37.833
Si Young!

35:37.833 --> 35:40.200
- Yes?
- Who is that woman?

35:40.200 --> 35:42.300
What is going on between you two?

35:42.300 --> 35:45.867
No, it's really not like that!

35:45.867 --> 35:48.633
Anyway, I'm sorry. It's all because of me.

35:50.133 --> 35:51.933
I...

35:51.933 --> 35:54.300
I will never, ever forgive her for this.

35:54.300 --> 35:57.167
I'll make her rot in prison for life!

35:57.167 --> 36:00.667
Aggravated assault? Adultery?

36:00.667 --> 36:03.167
Anyway, there are charges
with heavy sentences, right?

36:03.867 --> 36:06.400
You'll do that for me, right, Si Young?

36:09.000 --> 36:11.233
What on earth is going on?

36:11.233 --> 36:12.967
Hee Jin was assaulted?

36:12.967 --> 36:16.233
- Father!
- Oh, my dear.

36:16.233 --> 36:18.067
Are you badly hurt?

36:19.233 --> 36:21.667
But where?

36:21.667 --> 36:25.367
Oh, it's a bit scratched here.

36:25.367 --> 36:27.733
But the psychological shock
seems more severe.

36:27.733 --> 36:31.300
Who dares lay a hand on my daughter-in-law?

36:31.300 --> 36:32.367
Where is that woman?

36:32.367 --> 36:35.133
They say she's in the holding cell now.

36:35.133 --> 36:38.300
No settlement, no forgiveness,
absolutely none of that!

36:38.300 --> 36:40.567
Make sure she pays for it!

36:40.567 --> 36:42.767
Yes, Father.

36:42.767 --> 36:44.667
Oh dear.

36:45.888 --> 36:46.976
Jeez.

36:47.767 --> 36:49.633
Don't worry.

36:53.733 --> 36:59.067
[Kangseng Bookstore]

37:10.133 --> 37:12.267
We're closed.

37:22.633 --> 37:24.267
Tae Joo.

37:25.000 --> 37:26.900
What's with the bookstore?

37:28.800 --> 37:30.933
We decided to leave Kangseng.

37:33.367 --> 37:37.000
If this is because of me...

37:43.300 --> 37:47.367
It's because we can't imagine
living here without Ki Beom.

37:48.967 --> 37:50.333
Then where are you going?

37:50.333 --> 37:53.100
Near my in-laws' place.

37:53.100 --> 37:55.967
It's not completely unfamiliar,

37:55.967 --> 37:58.800
and I think that would be better.

38:05.233 --> 38:06.723
Sun Young

38:07.488 --> 38:09.367
is okay, right?

38:11.633 --> 38:13.633
Thanks for yesterday.

38:19.833 --> 38:22.867
Ki Beom ended up like that because of me.

38:25.600 --> 38:27.808
I couldn't protect him.

38:27.808 --> 38:30.133
I'm sorry.

38:30.133 --> 38:31.933
I'm truly sorry.

38:32.967 --> 38:36.667
Ki Hwan, I promise you.

38:37.767 --> 38:41.000
I'll make sure those who did this to Ki Beom

38:41.000 --> 38:43.167
get punished.

38:44.667 --> 38:47.267
No matter how long it takes, I...

38:47.267 --> 38:48.967
I will, no matter what.

38:59.633 --> 39:01.984
I'm here just to tell you this.

39:01.984 --> 39:03.633
I should go now.

39:08.533 --> 39:10.300
Tae... Tae Joo!

39:16.133 --> 39:17.900
Let's

39:18.533 --> 39:20.867
never see each other again.

39:22.067 --> 39:24.000
Never again.

39:53.400 --> 39:55.033
Ki Hwan!

39:55.033 --> 39:56.633
Seok Man.

39:59.467 --> 40:01.900
What brings you here?

40:03.433 --> 40:06.867
Seok Man, did you really kill them?

40:06.867 --> 40:07.933
I mean, those women.

40:07.933 --> 40:09.300
No!

40:09.300 --> 40:11.500
Ki Hwan, it really wasn't me.

40:11.500 --> 40:13.360
I really

40:14.016 --> 40:16.300
didn't do anything.

40:22.700 --> 40:25.767
Then how did Ki Beom's handkerchief
end up with you?

40:26.967 --> 40:30.900
That... Ki Beom must have left it behind.

40:30.900 --> 40:33.400
Please ask Ki Beom about it.

40:34.533 --> 40:35.872
Seok Man.

40:36.900 --> 40:39.200
Ki Beom is dead.

40:42.533 --> 40:44.467
What?

40:44.467 --> 40:47.600
Why did Ki Beom...

40:49.333 --> 40:51.800
Wasn't he released?

40:53.900 --> 40:56.333
Hasn't anyone told you

40:56.333 --> 40:58.367
why Ki Beom died?

41:06.833 --> 41:09.733
Ki Beom was beaten to death by the police.

41:10.967 --> 41:13.967
If only you had been caught in time,

41:13.967 --> 41:16.233
that wouldn't have happened.

41:18.300 --> 41:22.000
Ki Hwan, it really wasn't me.

41:23.167 --> 41:25.667
Please believe me.

41:25.667 --> 41:27.467
Seok Man.

41:29.233 --> 41:31.933
If you keep this up,
you'll end up like Ki Beom.

41:34.367 --> 41:37.267
If you feel sorry for Ki Beom,

41:37.267 --> 41:41.267
repent and take your punishment.

41:47.800 --> 41:50.167
I really don't know

41:53.033 --> 41:56.400
how that handkerchief ended up with me.

42:04.300 --> 42:07.267
By any chance,
has my younger brother been here?

42:07.267 --> 42:10.033
No, he hasn't even shown his face lately.

42:10.033 --> 42:11.867
Tell Ki Beom to come visit.

42:11.867 --> 42:13.467
My daughters are looking for him.

42:13.467 --> 42:17.100
They're asking when the handsome guy
is coming. They're going crazy.

42:17.833 --> 42:19.433
Okay.

42:26.067 --> 42:27.800
Then I'll get going.

42:27.800 --> 42:30.267
Alright, take care.

42:37.667 --> 42:39.900
Please take good care of my mother, Uncle.

42:39.900 --> 42:43.367
Don't worry and just focus on moving.

42:43.367 --> 42:45.400
Okay.

42:45.400 --> 42:48.333
I'll come pick you up once the move is done.

42:51.500 --> 42:53.200
I'll be going now.

42:54.667 --> 42:56.633
Drive safely!

43:30.867 --> 43:32.467
Stay still.

43:39.533 --> 43:41.500
It'll be over soon.

43:47.400 --> 43:48.533
Are you dozing off now?

43:48.533 --> 43:52.467
Are you, you punk?

43:55.072 --> 43:57.088
Shh.

43:58.200 --> 44:03.033
Just five minutes.
Just five minutes, please...

44:03.033 --> 44:08.067
Then just say one thing.

44:08.067 --> 44:11.233
Say you killed Lee Joo Hee.

44:11.233 --> 44:14.533
Then I'll let you sleep as much as you want.

44:19.000 --> 44:20.967
You punk!

44:25.133 --> 44:27.700
Snap out of it, wake up!

44:27.700 --> 44:29.300
Im Seok Man!

44:32.400 --> 44:34.233
You punk!

44:36.767 --> 44:38.933
Sleepy? You sleepy?

44:38.933 --> 44:41.700
Want me to put you to sleep? You punk!

44:52.233 --> 44:55.933
Confess, and you'll only do
five years and get out.

44:55.933 --> 44:57.667
At this rate, you'll really end up
with the death penalty!

44:57.667 --> 45:01.200
Open your eyes, you punk! Answer me!
Open your eyes, you punk!

45:04.700 --> 45:06.967
Open your eyes, you punk!

45:29.216 --> 45:31.920
I... I...

45:34.500 --> 45:37.000
You killed them, right?

45:37.000 --> 45:42.200
You killed them. Answer me, Seok Man.

45:44.467 --> 45:46.167
I...

45:47.233 --> 45:49.533
I killed them.

45:51.267 --> 45:53.500
That's it, you punk!

45:53.500 --> 45:58.533
That's the answer I want, you punk!

46:01.600 --> 46:03.700
Good job, Seok Man.

46:03.700 --> 46:06.133
Oh, good boy!

46:06.133 --> 46:07.767
Well done.

46:09.533 --> 46:11.233
What did you just say?

46:11.233 --> 46:13.067
- You confessed?
- Oh gosh...

46:13.067 --> 46:15.833
What on earth were you thinking?

46:15.833 --> 46:17.088
I...

46:19.872 --> 46:23.467
I don't even know myself.

46:23.467 --> 46:26.967
By the way, what day is it today?

46:27.800 --> 46:29.933
How long have I been here
since I was arrested?

46:29.933 --> 46:31.100
Why do you ask?

46:31.100 --> 46:35.267
Why haven't my father and sister
come to see me?

46:35.267 --> 46:36.433
Sir.

46:36.433 --> 46:39.967
Did you really reach out to my family?

46:42.500 --> 46:44.300
What is it?

46:46.267 --> 46:48.467
Did something happen?

46:48.467 --> 46:50.600
Well,

46:50.600 --> 46:55.100
they said they can't come because
they're afraid of what people might think.

46:57.700 --> 46:59.500
- What?
- If they come here,

46:59.500 --> 47:01.800
they'll be labeled
as the family of a serial killer.

47:01.800 --> 47:05.933
And they're afraid
they might even lose their jobs.

47:05.933 --> 47:09.900
And they said they want to
cut ties with you too.

47:12.500 --> 47:15.267
But I'm not the killer.

47:16.133 --> 47:18.367
- Why...
- What are you going to do then?

47:18.367 --> 47:22.267
Everyone's going around
saying you're a murderer.

47:24.128 --> 47:25.780
I...

47:41.333 --> 47:43.600
Shut up! Shut up, you punk!

47:43.600 --> 47:46.720
Why are you crying, you darn murderer!

47:46.720 --> 47:48.666
Darn it!

47:51.296 --> 47:52.919
Jeez.

47:57.633 --> 48:00.867
Please help cover up my sister's case.

48:01.733 --> 48:05.300
Then I'll quietly leave Kangseng.

48:05.300 --> 48:09.200
Are you admitting you hit Lee Ki Beom then?

48:09.200 --> 48:10.933
No,

48:10.933 --> 48:13.233
I'm saying I accept the disciplinary action.

48:13.233 --> 48:15.584
And someday,

48:15.584 --> 48:18.067
I'll prove the punishment was unfair.

48:18.967 --> 48:21.067
What?

48:21.067 --> 48:22.967
It's my fight.

48:24.100 --> 48:27.500
I won't let anyone else take it on.

48:27.500 --> 48:31.167
If someone's going to break, it'll be me.

48:34.067 --> 48:36.800
You're still going to fight to the end?

48:36.800 --> 48:38.667
Even when it's obvious you'll lose?

48:39.867 --> 48:42.800
If I fight to the end, then even if I lose,
it won't really be losing.

48:42.800 --> 48:44.233
It's like throwing an egg at a rock.

48:44.233 --> 48:46.133
I'm going to go for it anyway.

48:47.200 --> 48:49.900
Even if it breaks,
it'll leave the stench of rot behind.

48:53.433 --> 48:56.667
It can't stay a rock forever.

48:56.667 --> 48:59.133
If it keeps getting worn down,

48:59.133 --> 49:01.500
there'll come a day he becomes just a pebble.

49:06.167 --> 49:08.067
Now, I understand

49:09.433 --> 49:13.033
why that punk felt so inferior to you.

49:14.067 --> 49:17.033
You two were born the same,

49:17.033 --> 49:19.367
but you have something he doesn't.

49:21.233 --> 49:22.700
What do you mean "born the same"?

49:22.700 --> 49:24.500
Oh!

49:26.900 --> 49:30.800
My stepmother, that punk's mother,

49:30.800 --> 49:33.067
used to work at a bar.

49:33.067 --> 49:35.300
Just like your mother.

49:35.300 --> 49:37.900
My father met her there too.

49:48.600 --> 49:50.433
Why didn't you tell me?

49:50.433 --> 49:52.667
That your mom works as a hostess?

50:03.333 --> 50:05.567
Do you want me to spill

50:05.567 --> 50:07.433
[Kang Tae Joo, son of a bar hostess]
who you really are?

50:08.233 --> 50:10.533
Everyone should know what they need to know.

50:32.672 --> 50:38.233
- They're here.
- Please give us a statement.

50:38.233 --> 50:40.333
Hey, snap out of it

50:40.333 --> 50:42.833
and follow what we practiced, got it?

50:42.833 --> 50:45.633
Answer me, you punk!

50:46.567 --> 50:47.867
Alright, please step aside.

50:47.867 --> 50:50.200
Alright, please step aside!
We'll begin the reenactment.

50:50.200 --> 50:52.800
Ask questions after it's over.

50:52.800 --> 50:54.533
- It's him!
- How did you do it?

50:54.533 --> 50:57.300
Please move aside!

50:57.300 --> 50:59.767
- Hey!
- Can you answer a few questions?

50:59.767 --> 51:01.800
Move!

51:01.800 --> 51:05.100
So, we'll start the crime scene
reenactment now.

51:05.100 --> 51:08.000
Alright, how did you get into
the house from here?

51:08.800 --> 51:10.967
How did you get in, you punk!

51:12.033 --> 51:15.233
- I climbed over the wall...
- Climb over, quickly.

51:16.600 --> 51:18.267
That's it!

51:20.833 --> 51:22.633
That's how it happened.

51:23.733 --> 51:25.733
Get over it, quickly!

51:26.633 --> 51:28.633
Is that how you got over?

51:30.633 --> 51:32.867
Hey!

51:32.867 --> 51:34.567
- Hey, you punk!
- How is he supposed to climb like that?

51:34.567 --> 51:36.600
Get your head together!

51:36.600 --> 51:38.233
This punk...

51:40.233 --> 51:42.967
You punk, you really wanna die?

51:42.967 --> 51:44.600
Just do it like we practiced at the station!

51:44.600 --> 51:46.767
- Quickly, quickly!
- You punk!

51:46.767 --> 51:48.333
Get over it quickly, you punk!

51:48.333 --> 51:50.167
Alright, he's climbing over.

51:50.167 --> 51:52.167
Okay, come on over!

51:52.167 --> 51:53.767
That's it!

51:53.767 --> 51:57.333
Alright, snap out of it, you punk!

52:04.833 --> 52:07.533
- Please clear the way for a second!
- Just a moment.

52:07.533 --> 52:09.333
Jeez, this punk, seriously.

52:09.333 --> 52:10.433
What are you doing now?

52:10.433 --> 52:12.300
What? Oh, you're here.

52:12.300 --> 52:14.267
What is this, are we filming a comedy?

52:14.267 --> 52:16.967
Well, maybe this punk hasn't eaten.

52:18.233 --> 52:19.700
So what, you're just going to watch?

52:19.700 --> 52:22.333
- Pardon?
- Help him out! Prop something up at least.

52:22.333 --> 52:23.667
Oh, okay.

52:23.667 --> 52:25.633
Step aside. Move.

52:26.633 --> 52:28.300
Alright, what are you doing?

52:28.300 --> 52:30.300
Alright, step on this and get over quick!

52:30.300 --> 52:32.433
One, two!

52:34.600 --> 52:37.300
Is the suspect unable
to climb the wall by himself?

52:38.080 --> 52:42.033
He does have a bit of a leg issue.

52:42.033 --> 52:45.600
Maybe he is nervous.
Looks like he lost some strength.

52:45.600 --> 52:47.500
It's not a big issue.

52:50.233 --> 52:52.233
It's done.

52:52.233 --> 52:54.467
Grab him, grab him!

52:54.467 --> 52:56.367
Grab him, hurry!

53:01.167 --> 53:02.400
Alright, you're up.

53:02.400 --> 53:04.633
Did you get over this?

53:04.633 --> 53:05.867
You must have gotten over, right?

53:05.867 --> 53:08.700
Yeah, alright. You got over, you got over.

53:08.700 --> 53:10.867
Okay, you got over.

53:10.867 --> 53:13.267
Then what did you do next?

53:13.267 --> 53:15.300
What did you do?

53:15.300 --> 53:17.633
Hey, you said you covered her mouth first!

53:17.633 --> 53:19.433
Yeah...

53:22.368 --> 53:23.967
Think calmly.

53:23.967 --> 53:26.233
Seeing how they work, it's really...

53:27.167 --> 53:30.367
How come there's not a single guy
who works as well as Kang Tae Joo?

53:30.367 --> 53:33.312
You punk, hurry.

53:34.688 --> 53:36.367
You pressed down on her neck, right?

53:36.367 --> 53:39.616
Seriously, Tae Joo, you could've done better.

53:39.616 --> 53:42.240
You pressed hard, didn't you? Come on.

53:42.240 --> 53:45.989
- They're out!
- Can you give us a statement?

53:45.989 --> 53:48.960
- Just a few questions.
- Why did you do it?

54:13.867 --> 54:15.467
Huh?

54:23.133 --> 54:24.400
What is he saying?

54:24.400 --> 54:26.767
Sir! Congratulations.

54:26.767 --> 54:28.067
The reenactment went well today.

54:28.067 --> 54:30.752
Is this really something to celebrate?

54:32.333 --> 54:35.967
We regret the delay in arresting the suspect
and the suffering of the bereaved families.

54:35.967 --> 54:40.000
Why did you start doing the reenactment
from the 7th case?

54:40.000 --> 54:45.000
Unlike the others, the 7th case
took place inside a house,

54:45.000 --> 54:49.167
and we wanted to proceed
while the scene was less disturbed.

54:51.500 --> 54:54.500
Yes, that's why we did it. Please wrap it up.

54:57.000 --> 54:59.300
I heard Kang Tae Joo is leaving Kangseng.

54:59.300 --> 55:01.167
He's moving to Muwon.

55:02.733 --> 55:05.133
So this is really the end now.

55:06.233 --> 55:08.000
You've worked hard.

55:31.700 --> 55:34.167
What rock?

55:34.167 --> 55:36.633
You're just a pebble.

55:43.400 --> 55:46.100
What on earth was he saying?

55:48.933 --> 55:51.700
I'm definitely going to smash you!

55:52.900 --> 55:54.933
You little pebble punk!

56:03.567 --> 56:05.900
You waited long, didn't you?

56:07.233 --> 56:09.133
I'm sorry.

56:10.900 --> 56:13.033
I'll come more often from now on.

56:18.767 --> 56:22.300
I miss you, Ki Beom.

56:45.200 --> 56:46.833
Ki Beom.

56:47.900 --> 56:50.700
Sun Young looks really distressed.

56:54.733 --> 56:57.967
I'm thinking of sending her to join you.
What do you think?

56:57.967 --> 57:00.067
So you won't be lonely.

57:01.533 --> 57:03.967
Oh, Ms. Kang!

57:03.967 --> 57:06.500
Hye Jin! Are you on your way home?

57:06.500 --> 57:08.367
Yes! Ms. Kang.

57:08.367 --> 57:12.333
Can I visit your house this Sunday?

57:12.333 --> 57:13.733
Of course!

57:13.733 --> 57:15.667
What do you want to eat?

57:16.600 --> 57:17.900
Ice cream?

57:17.900 --> 57:19.267
Ice cream?

57:19.267 --> 57:22.767
Then shall we eat ice cream
together that day?

57:24.480 --> 57:27.072
You are that happy?

57:35.800 --> 57:37.700
You really won't go?

57:41.667 --> 57:44.267
It's not that I don't blame you, Tae Joo.

57:47.967 --> 57:51.067
I know, it's not your fault.

57:51.933 --> 57:54.432
I understand it in my head,

57:54.432 --> 57:56.433
but my heart doesn't feel that way.

57:59.500 --> 58:02.600
- Sun Young.
- Please.

58:02.600 --> 58:05.367
Let's not see each other for a while.

58:39.000 --> 58:41.500
Ms. Kang!

58:41.500 --> 58:43.000
You're Hye Jin's mother, right?

58:43.000 --> 58:46.600
Has Hye Jin come here by any chance?

58:46.600 --> 58:49.600
No, is something wrong?

58:49.600 --> 58:52.700
Hye Jin didn't come home yesterday.

58:52.700 --> 58:54.600
What?

59:05.467 --> 59:11.967
[Thank you for your support,
Cha Mu Jin, Liberty Republic Party]

59:11.967 --> 59:15.648
[I'll be a worker for Kangseng.
Cha Mu Jin, Liberty Republic Party]

59:20.433 --> 59:26.033
[Thank you, Cha Mu Jin]

59:26.033 --> 59:28.267
Your Honor,

59:29.133 --> 59:31.867
for the defendant who cruelly took

59:31.867 --> 59:34.700
the lives of seven innocent people,

59:34.700 --> 59:39.033
I request the maximum penalty
of the court, death.

59:39.767 --> 59:41.933
- What?
- What? No!

59:41.933 --> 59:43.733
Death?

59:45.700 --> 59:48.567
Defendant, please be seated.

59:54.200 --> 59:56.896
[1988 Model Civil Servant Awards Ceremony]

01:00:09.633 --> 01:00:13.800
We'll now begin the Model Civil Servant
Awards Ceremony.

01:00:13.800 --> 01:00:17.667
The awards will be presented
by Minister of Home Affairs Mun Hyo Seok.

01:00:17.667 --> 01:00:20.933
Please welcome him with applause!

01:00:25.567 --> 01:00:30.633
Alright, those called, please come forward.

01:00:30.633 --> 01:00:32.733
Superintendent Cha Jun Young,

01:00:32.733 --> 01:00:34.533
Sergeant Jang Myeong Do,

01:00:34.533 --> 01:00:36.267
Sergeant Do Hyeong Gu,

01:00:36.267 --> 01:00:38.800
Corporal Park Dae Ho,

01:00:39.433 --> 01:00:44.133
and lastly, Prosecutor Cha Si Young,
please step forward.

01:00:54.400 --> 01:00:55.800
Certificate of Commendation.

01:00:55.800 --> 01:00:59.533
Prosecutor Cha Si Young of the Muwon District
Prosecutors' Office, Kangseng Branch.

01:00:59.533 --> 01:01:01.600
Sir, are you sure you really saw it?

01:01:01.600 --> 01:01:03.567
Yes, I'm telling you, I saw it.

01:01:03.567 --> 01:01:07.533
It was just lying right here!

01:01:07.533 --> 01:01:10.433
Hey, Detective Kang, anything there?

01:01:10.433 --> 01:01:12.233
Yeah, there is something!

01:01:12.233 --> 01:01:13.800
There is? What is it?

01:01:13.800 --> 01:01:16.567
Vomit. That guy's vomit.

01:01:16.567 --> 01:01:18.000
What?

01:01:18.000 --> 01:01:20.333
You must've been pretty drunk yesterday, huh?

01:01:20.333 --> 01:01:22.733
Yeah, right. This is the spot.

01:01:22.733 --> 01:01:24.633
I threw up and looked to the side, and...

01:01:24.633 --> 01:01:29.300
Well, there was a woman's body right there.

01:01:29.300 --> 01:01:32.200
But why isn't it here now?

01:01:32.200 --> 01:01:35.533
Oh dear, if you drink too much,
you start seeing things.

01:01:35.533 --> 01:01:38.133
There it goes again, jeez.

01:01:38.133 --> 01:01:40.067
Alright, everyone, dismissed!

01:01:40.067 --> 01:01:41.967
- Let's go!
- Yes, sir!

01:01:41.967 --> 01:01:45.567
Lay off the booze! Don't make people
dig around for nothing, seriously.

01:01:45.567 --> 01:01:48.000
Jeez, let's go!

01:02:13.000 --> 01:02:14.600
Sir!

01:02:14.600 --> 01:02:18.033
The body you said you saw,
what did it look like?

01:02:18.033 --> 01:02:20.067
She was naked!

01:02:20.067 --> 01:02:22.633
I thought it was a mannequin.

01:02:22.633 --> 01:02:26.067
The hands and feet? Were they tied up?

01:02:26.067 --> 01:02:31.433
Well, I don't remember clearly.

01:03:04.200 --> 01:03:07.533
Everyone, please give a round of applause!

01:03:39.833 --> 01:03:42.933
Any idea what these two could be?

01:03:45.900 --> 01:03:49.467
You specifically separated those two cases,

01:03:50.500 --> 01:03:53.467
so that must have been
very memorable for you too, right?

01:03:53.467 --> 01:03:57.667
Of course, I can't forget either of them.

01:03:58.272 --> 01:04:00.233
Oh dear.

01:04:00.233 --> 01:04:04.267
If I reveal this,
the whole country will go crazy.

01:04:04.267 --> 01:04:08.333
Police and prosecutors
will all be in trouble.

01:04:09.100 --> 01:04:11.040
So what,

01:04:11.040 --> 01:04:13.000
should I not confess?

01:04:15.367 --> 01:04:19.067
Hey, Tae Joo, should you ask,

01:04:19.067 --> 01:04:21.667
I can keep quiet.

01:04:23.500 --> 01:04:24.900
What do you think?

01:04:24.900 --> 01:04:26.900
Come on, what are friends for?

01:04:26.900 --> 01:04:29.767
- I'm asking you.
- Yeah, sure.

01:04:29.767 --> 01:04:32.633
Just tell me everything truthfully.

01:04:33.267 --> 01:04:36.333
I want to know the truth about this case.

01:04:37.100 --> 01:04:39.533
Every single detail.

01:04:41.667 --> 01:04:43.667
Are you serious?

01:04:45.733 --> 01:04:48.000
You'll regret it, though.

01:04:49.800 --> 01:04:51.867
I'm begging you.

01:04:56.700 --> 01:04:59.933
[Murder: 12+2]

01:04:59.933 --> 01:05:02.000
One of them

01:05:02.767 --> 01:05:04.833
was a child.

01:05:06.967 --> 01:05:11.067
A very young girl.

01:05:48.300 --> 01:05:52.100
The killings are not over yet.

01:05:52.100 --> 01:05:54.000
It's him, the Kangseng Serial Killer!

01:05:54.000 --> 01:05:57.733
So, you mean someone who has seen the body
could go commit a copycat murder?

01:05:57.733 --> 01:06:00.367
The prosecutor is now trying to
frame the witness as a criminal.

01:06:00.367 --> 01:06:01.500
They're hiding something.

01:06:01.500 --> 01:06:02.500
Were there any suspicious incidents?

01:06:02.500 --> 01:06:05.833
- But it's a child. An eight-year-old girl.
- Ms. Kang.

01:06:05.833 --> 01:06:07.967
You punk! Why are you making trouble here?

01:06:07.967 --> 01:06:09.667
- What did he say that got you worked up?
- Hey, stop.

01:06:09.667 --> 01:06:11.900
And now what? A serial killer, you say?

01:06:11.900 --> 01:06:15.800
Kang Tae Joo, do you even know
what I went through for this?
